<section begin="intro" />
'''Conductive Sphere''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Gyre}}'s {{A|Arcsphere}} that causes projectiles traveled through it to inflict {{D|Electricity}} damage and guaranteed status effects.
